  "description": "<div style=\"font-family:Poppins;\"><p>About our brand and products</p><p>3 Baristas Coffee Roasters is a specialty coffee company based in Stuart, Florida. We roast small-batch coffee daily. </p><p>At 3 Baristas Coffee Roasters, our story began in 1991 -long before specialty coffee became a trend.  Roasting is not just what we do; it's who we are.  It's tradition, craftsmanship, and passion passed down through decades.</p><p>We source our organic coffees directly from the farms., building real relationships with growers who care about quality as much as we do. No middle shortcuts. No compromises.  Just Honest coffee from dedicated farms around the world.</p><p>We believe great coffee should tell a story - of the soil, the sun, the farmer, and roaster. From our family to your cup, every bag reflects over 30 years of experience, integrity, and love for the craft.</p><p>Fresh. Organic. Roasted to order. Since 1991.</p></div>",
